description: Produce the smallest user-facing report that preserves every material fact about a task outcome, by 
classifying the terminal state, comparing it against the contract, filtering activity out, and checking that no 
material fact was lost to compression. Use this skill at a task boundary — when work is complete, partial, blocked, or 
failed — whenever the user asks what the outcome was or for a summary of what was accomplished, and whenever an 
execution run ends and its result must be communicated. Reports consequences and evidence, never the execution 
trajectory.
